Wait, let me check the bit positions. Mode bits for permissions:
- Owner: bits 8-6 (r=8, w=4, x=2) → `mode >> 8` gives r, `mode >> 7` gives w, `mode >> 6` gives x
- Group: bits 5-3 → `mode >> 5` gives r, `mode >> 4` gives w, `mode >> 3` gives x
- Other: bits 2-0 → `mode >> 2` gives r, `mode >> 1` gives w, `mode >> 0` gives x

So:
```
bits[0] = (mode & 0400) != 0  // owner read
bits[1] = (mode & 0200) != 0  // owner write
bits[2] = (mode & 0100) != 0  // owner execute
bits[3] = (mode & 0040) != 0  // group read
bits[4] = (mode & 0020) != 0  // group write
bits[5] = (mode & 0010) != 0  // group execute
bits[6] = (mode & 0004) != 0  // other read
bits[7] = (mode & 0002) != 0  // other write
bits[8] = (mode & 0001) != 0  // other execute
```

